3b. Build the port (Node-API addon, Python extension, shared library)

Usage: mojo-anything build [OPTIONS] [CRATE_DIR]

Arguments:
  [CRATE_DIR]  [default: .]

Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>  Target: this machine [default: host] [possible values: host]
  -h, --help               Print help (see more with '--help')
